At least, yet another message that gave me pause.

I was in Sokoban making my way back down with the amulet of
Reflection, when I came across a tin.  Having not eaten in a while, I
decided to tuck in.  I get this:

It is not so easy to open this tin.  It explodes!

At first, I don't know what's going on.  It didn't give me any --
