still at full, so I'm waiting for the other shoe to drop.  I wondered
if cursed tins sometimes exploded, and if it was waiting to tell me
that I'm now permanently blind from shrapnel or something.

I advance a turn and find out I was just attacked by a black light.
Phew.  The tin smelled like killer tomatoes, too.

